{"unit_id":"shengyvself__dsh-autoresume#card-zh","repo":"shengyvself/dsh-autoresume","commit":"ae42f768dc9d2beec0c2e2e48c6ffad591c02cd8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-autoresume 是面向 DSH Web 的会话自动接续插件：它在 Web 启动后扫描本机持久化会话事件，并持续轮询状态；检测到运行中断或可重试的上游错误时，会向空闲会话注入「继续」消息。它识别网络、限流和服务端故障，并用连续失败守卫避免反复空转；用户停止的轮次和已有待处理输入会被保留，不会重复注入。适合希望在 Web 重启或模型暂时故障后接回未完成任务的 DSH 用户。需要兼容的 DSH Web 客户端包和 Node.js 运行环境，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.js:46","lib/service.js:278","lib/service.js:1019","cordis.patch.yml:3"]}
{"unit_id":"shengyvself__dsh-autoresume#card-en","repo":"shengyvself/dsh-autoresume","commit":"ae42f768dc9d2beec0c2e2e48c6ffad591c02cd8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-autoresume resumes DSH Web sessions after restarts and retryable model errors. It scans local events and injects “continue” into interrupted idle sessions. Loop and queue guards stop repeated empty retries and skip pending input. Requires DSH packages and Node.js; no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/service.js:46","lib/service.js:278","lib/service.js:1019","cordis.patch.yml:3"]}
